<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 123.88 mln rand S.African bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 123.88 mln rand S.African bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 123.88  million rand worth of South African bonds on Monday after selling a net 174.55 million rand on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27</p>
</text>
